  @invariant  grid.chanFirst/Last/lane1Col are chan-keyed; numRows is int  @ 16
  @invariant  selection part names: pitch/vel/delay on note; pb on pb; val on scalar  @ 22
  @contract  the current instance stepped ±1 along its track's placements, in start order  @ 383
  @contract  only a MIDI take in a slot is a stop; holds at the ends, crosses to no other track  @ 384
